sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor H as Host / creator
 participant API as Party API
 participant S as Party services
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 H->>API: POST /parties with data + session/CSRF
 API->>API: Guard, parse and validate payload
 API->>S: create_party(trusted user, fields)
 S->>S: Validate dates, venue/sport/opening hours and capacity
 S->>DB: Atomic insert Party and Host membership
 API-->>H: 201 or validation error (no partial rows)
 H->>API: PATCH /parties/{id} or POST /parties/{id}/cancel
 API->>S: edit_party / cancel_party
 S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party
 S->>S: Check Host, read clock after lock
 alt Missing / forbidden / started / cancelled edit
 S->>DB: ROLLBACK
 API-->>H: 404 / 403 / 409
 else Allowed
 alt Edit
 S->>S: Validate merged fields and capacity >= active count
 S->>DB: Save fields, retain requests and memberships
 else Cancel
 S->>DB: Set cancelled_at (repeat preserves first time)
 end
 S->>DB: COMMIT (any write error rolls back)
 API-->>H: 200
 end
 Note over S,DB: Cancel retry succeeds even after start if already cancelled
